ogic Pro shows in one of its views, ready to draw: pass kind, and ref (the take, track or pattern it is about) or window (the range to show) where the kind takes them. Long ones come in pages: pass the nextCursor as cursor.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"The Logic Pro process to use, from discover, when several run."},"resource":{"type":"string","description":"The Logic Pro to use, by its bundle id (com.apple.logic10) from discover, when several run."},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["tree","notes","timeline","routing"],"description":"Which view."},"ref":{"type":"string","description":"The ref of what the view is about: a track for tree and routing, a region for notes (the selected one when left out)."},"around":{"type":"string","description":"The ref of a track to centre the first page of the timeline's lanes on: the page starts half a page above it, and says where in `from`."},"window":{"type":"object","properties":{"from":{"type":"number"},"to":{"type":"number"}},"required":["from","to"],"additionalProperties":false,"description":"The range of the timeline to show, in beats from the project's start."},"cursor":{"type":"string","description":"The nextCursor an earlier page gave, unchanged."},"limit":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"description":"Rows in a page."}},"required":["kind"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"change_preview","title":"Preview a Logic Pro change","description":"What one change would do in Logic Pro, without making it: {transactionId, confirmation, prior, display, target, epoch}. Apply it with change_apply.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"The Logic Pro process to use, from discover, when several run."},"resource":{"type":"string","description":"The Logic Pro to use, by its bundle id (com.apple.logic10) from discover, when several run."},"kind":{"type":"string","description":"The change kind."},"input":{"type":"object","description":"What the kind takes."},"epoch":{"type":"string","description":"The epoch the refs in input came from."}},"required":["kind","input"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":true,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"change_apply","title":"Apply a Logic Pro change","description":"Makes a previewed change in Logic Pro, as one named step of Logic Pro's undo. The same idempotencyKey again returns the first answer and changes nothing. state is applied, or uncertain when Logic Pro didn't answer.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"transactionId":{"type":"string"},"confirmation":{"type":"string","description":"The confirmation change_preview gave."},"idempotencyKey":{"type":"string"},"title":{"type":"string","description":"The change's name in Logic Pro's undo history."}},"required":["transactionId","confirmation","idempotencyKey"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"change_undo","title":"Undo a Logic Pro change","description":"Takes a change back as a new named step in Logic Pro: exactly what it changed is put back. Refused (code changed) if those values changed since, unless discard.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"transactionId":{"type":"string"},"confirmation":{"const":"undo"},"idempotencyKey":{"type":"string"},"discard":{"type":"boolean","description":"Put the values back even if they changed since."}},"required":["transactionId","confirmation","idempotencyKey"],"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":true,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"transport_stop","title":"Stop Logic Pro","description":"Stops Logic Pro's playback and recording at once.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"The Logic Pro process to use, from discover, when several run."},"resource":{"type":"string","description":"The Logic Pro to use, by its bundle id (com.apple.logic10) from discover, when several run."}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"transport_play","title":"Play Logic Pro","description":"Starts Logic Pro's playback from where it is, or (Renoise) from sequence (a slot, from 1) and line.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"The Logic Pro process to use, from discover, when several run."},"resource":{"type":"string","description":"The Logic Pro to use, by its bundle id (com.apple.logic10) from discover, when several run."},"sequence":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"line":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"epoch":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"cursor_set","title":"Move Logic Pro's cursor","description":"Moves Logic Pro's edit cursor to positionBeats (quarter notes from the start) or position (seconds); the play position follows while it plays.","inputSchema":{"type":"object","properties":{"pid":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"The Logic Pro process to use, from discover, when several run."},"resource":{"type":"string","description":"The Logic Pro to use, by its bundle id (com.apple.logic10) from discover, when several run."},"positionBeats":{"type":"number","minimum":0},"position":{"type":"number","minimum":0},"epoch":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false},"annotations":{"readOnlyHint":false,"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false}},{"name":"undo_step_begin","title":"Begin one Logic Pro undo step","description":"Opens one step of Logic Pro's undo around the changes that follow, where Logic Pro gives o